:: StoryTitle
The Lighthouse

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "D674C58C-DEFA-4F70-B7A2-27742230C0FC",
  "format": "Harlowe",
  "start": "Shore"
}

:: Shore {"position":"100,100"}
Waves break on the rocks. The lighthouse is dark tonight.

[[Climb to the light->Stairs]]
[[Wait for morning|Morning]]

:: Stairs [tense] {"position":"300,100"}
The stairs spiral up. (set: $tired to true) A door stands at the top.
You can [[open the door->Lamp room]] or [[go back down|Shore]].

:: Lamp room {"position":"500,100"}
You light the lamp. Far out, a ship turns away from the rocks.

:: Morning [death] {"position":"300,300"}
By morning the ship is on the rocks.

:: Keeper {"position":"500,300"}
The keeper is asleep. [[Wake him->Nowhere]]
[[Leave him|Shore]]

:: StoryInit
(set: $tired to false)

